description:
DermaMNIST (64x64 resolution) mean ( mean_reshaped.npy ) and standard deviation ( std_reshaped.npy ) calculated on the training set; 
 DermaMNIST's covariance matrix's (64x64 resolution) eigenvalues ( eigenvalues.npy ), the ratio of total variance explained by each principal component ( eigenvalues_ratio.npy)  and DermaMNIST's principal components ( pc_matrix.npy ) computed using the normalized training dataset. 
 These items were computed from the DermaMNIST dataset [1] and there used in [2].

BloodMNIST (64x64 resolution) mean ( mean_reshaped.npy ) and standard deviation ( std_reshaped.npy ) calculated on the training set; 
 BloodMNIST's covariance matrix's (64x64 resolution) eigenvalues ( eigenvalues.npy ), the ratio of total variance explained by each principal component ( eigenvalues_ratio.npy)  and BloodMNIST's principal components ( pc_matrix.npy ) computed using the normalized training dataset. 
 These items were computed from the BloodMNIST dataset [1] and there used in [2].
